  "body": "…. This includes projects for the core library (BitNet.Core), a command-line runner (BitNet.Run), and tests (BitNet.Core.Tests).\r\n\r\nI had to create all the project files (.csproj) and the solution file (.sln) manually, as I encountered an issue that prevented me from using the `dotnet` CLI.\r\n\r\nI have ported the core GGUF model reading logic and kernel stubs from the original C++ and Python sources, set up a basic command-line interface using System.CommandLine, and added an initial xUnit test to validate GGUF model reading.\r\n\r\nPlease note that due to the aforementioned issue, I have not been able to compile or test this code yet.",
